====Definitions====
{{head|zh|hanzi}}

# [[bamboo]]-made [[implement]] for [[hold]]ing [[soil]]
# [[bamboo]]-made [[cage]] (for [[animal]]s); [[coop]]
#* {{zh-x|一 雀 適 ^羿，^羿 必 得 之，威 也；以 天下 為 之 籠，則 雀 無 所 逃。|If a single sparrow came within Archer Yi's range, he was sure to bring it down—impressive shooting. But he might have made the whole world into a '''cage''', and then the sparrows would have had no place to flee to.|ref=Zhuangzi}}
